{
  "pages": [
    {
      "page_idx": 22,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "header",
          "bbox": [
            0.671,
            0.048,
            0.86,
            0.066
          ],
          "content": "Tales by Dots and Lines"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.286,
            0.119,
            0.464,
            0.19
          ],
          "content": "I wonder if there is anything common in all the states preferring rice or states preferring wheat."
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.083,
            0.857,
            0.352
          ],
          "content": "",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [
            {
              "bbox": [
                0.53,
                0.132,
                0.717,
                0.177
              ],
              "content": "I want to know if the preferences were similar even 100 years ago."
            }
          ],
          "image_source": "images/page_22_image_2.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.153,
            0.373,
            0.418,
            0.395
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "What can a Strip Say?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.404,
            0.645,
            0.497
          ],
          "content": "Manoj has an interesting hobby. He makes note of what he does throughout the day. He records his activities by colouring a strip of paper with 48 boxes, marking time in 30 minute intervals from midnight to midnight."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.496,
            0.646,
            0.553
          ],
          "content": "He has recorded five types of activities for three different days of the week on three coloured strips, shown to the right."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.203,
            0.557,
            0.326,
            0.578
          ],
          "content": "(i) Sleeping"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.198,
            0.58,
            0.306,
            0.601
          ],
          "content": "(ii) Eating"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.192,
            0.604,
            0.644,
            0.643
          ],
          "content": "(iii) Meeting friends, hobbies, media, time with family"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.192,
            0.647,
            0.645,
            0.668
          ],
          "content": "(iv) Attending classes, studying and homework"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.198,
            0.671,
            0.645,
            0.709
          ],
          "content": "(v) Showering and getting dressed, yoga or exercise"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.193,
            0.713,
            0.343,
            0.734
          ],
          "content": "(vi) Travelling"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.735,
            0.567,
            0.758
          ],
          "content": "Look at the three coloured strips carefully."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.202,
            0.765,
            0.64,
            0.786
          ],
          "content": "(i) What activity does each colour stand for?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.198,
            0.789,
            0.645,
            0.848
          ],
          "content": "(ii) The three strips correspond to the days Friday – Sunday in some order. Which day do you think each strip represents?"
        },
        {
          "type": "chart",
          "bbox": [
            0.657,
            0.378,
            0.922,
            0.856
          ],
          "content": "",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "images/page_22_chart_16.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.192,
            0.85,
            0.847,
            0.891
          ],
          "content": "(iii) On one of these days, he went out with friends to watch a long movie. When do you think this happened?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.193,
            0.892,
            0.682,
            0.914
          ],
          "content": "(iv) At what time does his school break for lunch?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.199,
            0.916,
            0.56,
            0.938
          ],
          "content": "(v) What more can the strips tell us?"
        },
        {
          "type": "page_number",
          "bbox": [
            0.87,
            0.913,
            0.918,
            0.935
          ],
          "content": "125"
        }
      ]
    }
